{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流れ星 銀とウィードは全巻もってますよーふっふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アラムが好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリオンはノータッチ...(ﾟ-ﾟ；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は広島でのイベント。しかも広島選抜(？)という新しい16人でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安だったんですけど、優しいみなさまのおかげで楽しいイベントにできたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おこしいただいたみなさまありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして乃木どこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに広島で放送するということで、嬉しい～～！ぜひ、もっと私たちのことを知ってくださいな(ｏ'∀'人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにホテルの部屋はれいかとかなりんでっした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島すきです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから必ず、また訪れたいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/5300348/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●料理は得意ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だしまきたまごと炒飯って感じです(ｏ'∀'人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●池袋とかに買物に行くことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ行ったことないですえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●湯船につかってるときする事がないんだけど何かオススメな事ってあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななは足の裏とふくらはぎをマッサージしたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽かけたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも基本、じーっとしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー。難しい。なんか探しときますね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/5300348/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学のときのやつ出てきたヘタっぴ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リメイクしたい。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}